<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body class="bg-background text-on-background font-body-md antialiased">

<%- include('partials/menu-lateral') %>

<div class="md:ml-64 min-h-screen flex flex-col">
  <%- include('partials/cabecalho') %>

  <main class="flex-1 mt-20 p-margin-mobile md:p-margin-desktop w-full max-w-[1600px] mx-auto">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-xl">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-xs text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm mb-sm">
          <a class="hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="/aprovacoes">Fila de Aprovações</a><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">chevron_right</span><span class="text-on-background">Solicitação #SOL-2024-089</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-start flex-wrap gap-md">
          <div><h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-background mb-xs">Solicitação de Alocação de Orçamento</h2><p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Revise os detalhes abaixo para aprovar ou rejeitar esta alocação.</p></div>
          <span class="bg-secondary-fixed-dim/20 text-secondary-container font-label-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full flex items-center gap-1 border border-secondary-fixed-dim"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]">pending</span>Aguardando Revisão</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-lg mb-xl">
        <div class="md:col-span-2 bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant rounded-xl p-lg shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-background mb-md border-b border-outline-variant pb-sm">Detalhes da Solicitação</h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-md mb-lg">
            <div><span class="block font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-1">Departamento</span><span class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-background">Cardiologia</span></div>
            <div><span class="block font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-1">Centro de Custo</span><span class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-background">CC-1049-CARD</span></div>
            <div><span class="block font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-1">Solicitado por</span><div class="flex items-center gap-sm"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center text-primary font-label-sm">SJ</div><span class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-background">Dra. Sarah Jenkins</span></div></div>
            <div><span class="block font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-1">Data de Envio</span><span class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-background">24 Out 2024</span></div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="block font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-1">Descrição / Justificativa</span>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-background bg-surface-container-low p-md rounded-lg border border-outline-variant/50">Solicitação de alocação adicional para o Q4 cobrindo custos de manutenção do novo equipamento de ressonância na Ala B. Crítico para manter as metas de atendimento no próximo trimestre.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant rounded-xl p-lg shadow-sm flex flex-col">
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-background mb-md border-b border-outline-variant pb-sm">Impacto Financeiro</h3>
          <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center">
            <div class="mb-md"><span class="block font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mb-1">Valor Solicitado</span><span class="font-display-lg-mobile text-display-lg-mobile text-primary font-bold">R$ 45.000</span></div>
            <div class="space-y-sm">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-2 border-b border-outline-variant/30"><span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Orçamento Atual</span><span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-background">R$ 1.250.000</span></div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-2 border-b border-outline-variant/30"><span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Restante (Antes)</span><span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-background">R$ 120.000</span></div>
              <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-2"><span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Restante (Depois)</span><span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-secondary-container">R$ 75.000</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant rounded-xl p-lg shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-background mb-md">Ação de Revisão</h3>
        <div class="mb-lg"><label class="block font-label-md text-label-md text-on-background mb-sm">Comentários / Justificativa da Revisão</label><textarea class="w-full bg-surface border border-outline-variant rounded-lg p-3 font-body-md text-body-md focus:outline-none focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20" rows="3" placeholder="Informe o motivo da aprovação ou rejeição..."></textarea></div>
        <div class="flex justify-end gap-md flex-wrap">
          <button class="px-xl py-3 rounded-full border border-error text-error font-label-md text-label-md hover:bg-error-container/10 transition-colors flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">close</span>Rejeitar Solicitação</button>
          <a href="/aprovacoes" class="px-xl py-3 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-md text-label-md hover:bg-primary-container transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 shadow-sm"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">check</span>Aprovar Solicitação</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</div>

</body>
</html>
